WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
It's 7 a.m.

2
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.400
Daniel's daily brief arrives in Slack.

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.720
His meetings, important emails, and
priorities all before his first coffee.

4
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.360
What would your morning look like if you
started that informed?

5
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.740
For Daniel, the problem was scattered
information.

6
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.080
Emails in one place, meetings in another,

7
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.560
deadlines buried in task lists.

8
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.460
His AI executive assistant brings it all
together.

9
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:30.800
Every morning, Daniel receives his
meetings, emails, and tasks in one

10
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.160
clear summary, delivered through Slack.

11
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:37.760
When he needs direction, he simply asks,
what should I focus on today?

12
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.280
If plans change, he asks his assistant to
arrange, move, or cancel a meeting.

13
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.340
It shows him the details and waits for his
approval.

14
00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:51.520
It also helps him understand emails in
multiple languages and prepares replies

15
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.460
in his preferred language, ready for him
to review before sending.

16
00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:00.700
Daniel starts informed, knows his
priorities, and stays in control.

17
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.480
Imagine that working for your business.

18
00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:07.860
Mark Automates, a little less admin, a lot
more you.
